---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Bidwell Capital" description="How Bidwell Capital collects, uses and protects your information.">
  <section class="hero-sm">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label fade-up fade-up-1">Privacy</span>
      <h1 class="fade-up fade-up-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="fade-up fade-up-3">Effective November 6, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you contact us, book a call or invest, we collect the information you give us: your name, email, phone number and, for investors, the details needed to verify accredited status, process subscriptions and send tax documents.</p>
      <p>Our website may record basic usage data, such as pages visited and browser type, to help us improve it.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use your information to respond to you, manage your investments, send required reports and updates, and meet our legal and tax obligations. We do not sell your information.</p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>We share information only with the service providers that help us run our business (for example our investor portal, accountants, fund administrators and banks), and only as needed for them to do that work. We may also disclose information when the law requires it.</p>

      <h2>Google account data</h2>
      <p>Bidwell Capital uses internal tools that connect to Google Workspace and Gmail accounts owned by Bidwell Capital and its principals, to read and organize our own email, documents and calendars. These tools are not offered to the public. Data accessed through Google APIs is used only to operate our own business, is not sold, is not used for advertising, and is not shared except as described above. Our use of information received from Google APIs follows the Google API Services User Data Policy, including its Limited Use requirements.</p>

      <h2>How we protect it</h2>
      <p>We limit access to people and systems that need it and use the security tools provided by our service providers. No system is perfectly secure, but we take reasonable steps to protect your information.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to update or delete your information, or to stop sending you updates, at any time. Some records must be kept to meet legal and tax requirements.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:adam@bidwellcapitalfund.com">adam@bidwellcapitalfund.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero-sm {
    padding: 5rem 0 2rem;
  }
  .hero-sm h1 { margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem; }
  .hero-sm p { font-size: 1.125rem; max-width: 60ch; }

  .prose {
    max-width: 48rem;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .prose p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
</style>
